__␀",u:1787000870631,s:"success",l:$R[3]={guideTrends:void 0},ssr:!0},$R[4]={i:"␀$username␀status␀$id␀␀Efloud␀status␀2037917969846579223␀{}",u:1787000870885,s:"success",l:$R[5]={conversationOptions:$R[6]={rankingMode:void 0},metadata:$R[7]={authorAvatarUrl:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_normal.jpg",authorDescription:"Sup bro? \nMostly TA, rarely FA. \nAlways chill out. \nTweets are not financial/investment advice. \n15.09.1966",authorName:"Efloud",focalTweetId:"2037917969846579223",hasArticle:!1,headMetadata:$R[8]={appLinkUrl:"twitter://status?id=2037917969846579223",articleTags:void 0,author:$R[9]={image:$R[10]={alt:"Efloud profile picture",url:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_400x400.jpg"},screenName:"Efloud",url:"https://x.com/Efloud"},bodyText:"@bit_osfer Arkadaşlar,\n\nÖğrenci arkadaşlarımıza yardım edelim, 10-12 kişiye 100 dolar dağıtalım diyorum - haliyle kanıt olarak transkript istiyorum. @bit_osfer sağ olsun, tek tek uğraşıyor. Buna rağmen birileri çıkıp showmen diyor, yardım yapacan show yapma diyor. Yalancısın, dağıtmıyorsun https://t.co/sguu3sHidK",canonicalPath:"/Efloud/status/2037917969846579223",canonicalUrl:"https://x.com/Efloud/status/2037917969846579223",description:"@bit_osfer Arkadaşlar,\n\nÖğrenci arkadaşlarımıza yardım edelim, 10-12 kişiye 100 dolar dağıtalım diyorum - haliyle kanıt olarak transkript istiyorum. @bit_osfer sağ olsun, tek tek uğraşıyor. Buna rağmen birileri çıkıp showmen diyor, yardım yapacan show yapma diyor. Yalancısın, dağıtmıyorsun",faviconUrl:void 0,hasAiGeneratedMedia:void 0,image:$R[11]={alt:void 0,height:980,isContent:!0,preloadUrl:"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HEgjTBwXoAAz2vH?format=webp&name=medium",url:"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HEgjTBwXoAAz2vH.png:large",width:688},isAdult:!1,isArticle:!1,jsonLd:$R[12]=[$R[13]={"@context":"https://schema.org","@id":"https://x.com/i/status/2037917969846579223","@type":"SocialMediaPosting",author:$R[14]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"Efloud",identifier:"1063939505827323904",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_400x400.jpg",name:"Efloud",url:"https://x.com/Efloud"},comment:$R[15]=[$R[16]={"@id":"https://x.com/kaanxbt/status/2037919659740008784","@type":"Comment",author:$R[17]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"kaanxbt",identifier:"1986827779418263552",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2077130381350846465/9Xh1zuiG_400x400.jpg",name:"KaanXBT",url:"https://x.com/kaanxbt"},commentCount:2,datePublished:"2026-03-28T15:48:04.000Z",identifier:"2037919659740008784",interactionStatistic:$R[18]=[$R[19]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/LikeAction",name:"Likes",url:"https://x.com/kaanxbt/status/2037919659740008784/likes",userInteractionCount:27},$R[20]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ShareAction",name:"Retweets",url:"https://x.com/kaanxbt/status/2037919659740008784/retweets",userInteractionCount:0},$R[21]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ReplyAction",name:"Replies",userInteractionCount:2},$R[22]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ViewAction",name:"Views",userInteractionCount:3611}],text:"@Efloud @bit_osfer Efe Abiyede dolandirici diyen zihniyet daha ne yapabilir ki bizi toplumca asagi ceken bu sark kurnazi zihniyet, umarim bir an once biter bunlar… \n\nAllah yardimlarini ve sevaplarini kabul etsin insallah Abi. Tesekkur ederim topluluk adina"},$R[23]={"@id":"https://x.com/maliibu/status/2037923838806176224","@type":"Comment",author:$R[24]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"maliibu",identifier:"1174943502888652806",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2080053939286810624/kL95PAVq_400x400.jpg",name:"Mehmet Said İNAL",url:"https://x.com/maliibu"},commentCount:0,datePublished:"2026-03-28T16:04:40.000Z",identifier:"2037923838806176224",interactionStatistic:$R[25]=[$R[26]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/LikeAction",name:"Likes",url:"https://x.com/maliibu/status/2037923838806176224/likes",userInteractionCount:24},$R[27]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ShareAction",name:"Retweets",url:"https://x.com/maliibu/status/2037923838806176224/retweets",userInteractionCount:0},$R[28]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ReplyAction",name:"Replies",userInteractionCount:0},$R[29]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ViewAction",name:"Views",userInteractionCount:1081}],text:"@Efloud @bit_osfer Yapsınlar da show yapsınlar. Yeter ki onlarda yapsın. \n\nBomboş adam kaynıyor her yer"},$R[30]={"@id":"https://x.com/heisenbergtrx/status/2037972703060336950","@type":"Comment",author:$R[31]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"heisenbergtrx",identifier:"1386950429809037315",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1578017187725549568/hUOHTERy_400x400.jpg",name:"Heisenberg",url:"https://x.com/heisenbergtrx"},commentCount:1,datePublished:"2026-03-28T19:18:50.000Z",identifier:"2037972703060336950",interactionStatistic:$R[32]=[$R[33]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/LikeAction",name:"Likes",url:"https://x.com/heisenbergtrx/status/2037972703060336950/likes",userInteractionCount:61},$R[34]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ShareAction",name:"Retweets",url:"https://x.com/heisenbergtrx/status/2037972703060336950/retweets",userInteractionCount:0},$R[35]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ReplyAction",name:"Replies",userInteractionCount:1},$R[36]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ViewAction",name:"Views",userInteractionCount:2211}],text:"@Efloud @bit_osfer Bu platformda haset ve kötü niyetli insan sayısı o kadar fazla ki… \n\nBurası insanların kendi karmasını, ilahi adalet terazisini kaydırdığı bir mecra oldu/oluyor. \n\nAma emin ol bu tip şeylere laf edenlerin ken